00:07:07,058 --> 00:07:13,058
Three lives. One destiny.

2
00:14:14,117 --> 00:14:20,117
Head in the Clouds is a drama, romance, war film directed by John Duigan.

3
00:21:21,176 --> 00:21:27,176
Gilda Bessé shares her Paris apartment with an Irish
schoolteacher, Guy Malyon, and Mia, a refugee from Spain.

4
00:28:28,235 --> 00:28:34,235
As the world drifts toward war, Gilda defiantly pursues her hedonistic
lifestyle and her burgeoning career as a photographer.

5
00:35:35,294 --> 00:35:41,294
But Guy and Mia feel impelled to join the fight against
fascism, and the three friends are separated.

6
