12
01:25:24,705 --> 01:25:30,705
Head in the Clouds is a 2004 Canadian-British war drama
film written and directed by John Duigan.

13
01:32:31,764 --> 01:32:37,764
The original screenplay focuses on the choices young lovers must make as they find
themselves surrounded by increasing political unrest in late-1930s Europe.

14
01:39:38,823 --> 01:39:44,823
The film was a critical and box office failure.

15
01:46:45,882 --> 01:46:51,882
The film explores themes of nazi, photographer, world war
ii, spanish civil war (1936-39), love.

16
01:53:52,941 --> 01:53:58,941
The tone is emotional.
